== Trivia ==
* The name "Lumina" is probably a reference to the fact that she sells items that can illuminate areas.
* Some dialogue lines are references to merchant dialogue lines in ''[[w:The Elder Scrolls V: Skyrim|Skyrim]]''. The original lines '''Lumina'''<nowiki>'</nowiki>s dialogue is based off of is displayed below.
:Looking to protect yourself, or deal some damage?<br>
:Hmm... Blades, helmets. Pretty much anything to suit your needs.<br>
:Good doin' business with ya.

